<title>UK: Timah at 15.7875 in London at 0829 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 15.7875 in London at 0829 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $15.7875 per GDR in London on Tuesday at around 0829 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $15.66 and a high of $15.7875.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday was $15.75.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
